    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Available from the 1st of October. \n\nGet Let are delighted to present this studio apartment to the rental market. Ideally located in The Olde Dock, just off Little Ship Street, this property comes to the market fully furnished and in great condition.\n\nLocated on the ground floor, this apartment benefits from an external communal patio area which can be accessed directly from the apartment itself. \n\nThe apartment briefly comprises an entrance hallway, a separate double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and fitted with a double bed, a living room come kitchen which is fully fitted with all appliances. A stylish, fully tiled bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nThe Olde Dock benefits from an excellent location within walking distance of every conceivable amenity. Trinity College, Grafton Street, Christchurch and Temple Bar are all within walking distance. Transport links are excellent, with the Green and Red Luas lines within easy reach, as well as numerous Dublin Bus routes.\n\nPlease be advised that there is no parking with this property.\n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended.\n\nTo register your interest, please email Amy Leonard of Get Let by clicking on Email Advertiser to the right of this advertisement. Please submit a detailed application including details of how many people it is for and when you wish to move in. Viewing places are limited, so the more detail you provide, the better chance you have of getting a viewing. Private viewings shall then take place by appointment only.\n\nGet Let is a subsidiary of Get Property Limited, PSRA number 002324."
      },
